  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is reacted with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>, 2-Chloropropane&nbsp;is formed. Thus, X is 2-Chloropropane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHClCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is reacted with alc. KOH , Propene&nbsp;is formed. Thus, Y is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>.</p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is treated with conc. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>, 2-Propanol <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is formed. Thus Z is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p>​​​<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/ba422fc1-8646-4d6c-9494-a589afabb8d3-image.png\" style=\"width: 451px; height: 270px;\" /></p>",
